#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum's open-source content {#ibm-quantums-open-source-content}"
msgstr "Contenu open-source d'IBM Quantum {#ibm-quantums-open-source-content}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM provides a wealth of quantum computing learning material — all open "
"source under CC BY-SA 4.0:\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM fournit une abondance de matériel d'apprentissage sur l'informatique "
"quantique — tout est open-source sous licence CC BY-SA 4.0 :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Learning](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning)** — Structured courses "
"from quantum basics to advanced topics\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Learning](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning)** — Cours structurés, "
"des bases quantiques aux sujets avancés\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Tutorials](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/tutorials)** — 40+ "
"tutorials on transpilation, error mitigation, and more\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Tutorials](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/tutorials)** — Plus de "
"40 tutoriels sur la transpilation, l'atténuation d'erreurs, et plus encore\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Documentation](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides)** — Guides "
"and API reference for Qiskit\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Documentation](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides)** — Guides "
"et référence API pour Qiskit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Source repo](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation)** — All content on "
"GitHub\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Source repo](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation)** — Tout le contenu"
" sur GitHub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Their [Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) is always up-to-date"
" and well-designed — the best place for reading, learning, and reference.\n"
msgstr ""
"Leur [Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) est toujours à jour "
"et bien conçue — le meilleur endroit pour lire, apprendre et consulter.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What this project adds {#what-this-project-adds}"
msgstr "Ce que ce projet ajoute {#what-this-project-adds}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM's [Qiskit documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation) is "
"open source (CC BY-SA 4.0), but their web application is not. doQumentation "
"adds an open-source frontend with live code execution, automatic credential "
"injection, and simulator mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"La [documentation Qiskit](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation) d'IBM est"
" open-source (CC BY-SA 4.0), mais leur application web ne l'est pas. "
"doQumentation ajoute une interface open-source avec exécution de code en "
"direct, injection automatique des identifiants, et mode simulateur.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deployable anywhere — from [GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org) to "
"[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)"
" to [RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/). See [all features](/features).\n"
msgstr ""
"Déployable partout — de [GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org) à "
"[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)"
" en passant par [RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/). Découvrez [toutes les "
"fonctionnalités](/features).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "When you're ready for more {#when-youre-ready-for-more}"
msgstr "Quand tu es prêt pour la suite {#when-youre-ready-for-more}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"doQumentation helps you take your **first steps with Qiskit** — read, run "
"code, and explore — without installing anything. As you progress, head to "
"IBM's official platform:\n"
msgstr ""
"doQumentation t'aide à faire tes **premiers pas avec Qiskit** — lire, "
"exécuter du code, et explorer — sans rien avoir à installer. Quand tu veux "
"aller plus loin, dirige-toi vers la plateforme officielle d'IBM :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Run on real hardware** — create a free [IBM Cloud "
"account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) and an Open Plan "
"instance to execute circuits on real quantum computers.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Exécuter sur du vrai matériel** — crée un [compte IBM "
"Cloud](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) gratuit et une instance "
"Open Plan pour exécuter des circuits sur de vrais ordinateurs quantiques.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Latest content** — IBM's [Qiskit learning "
"platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning) has the newest courses, "
"tutorials, and additions (some may not yet be in doQumentation).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Contenu le plus récent** — la [plateforme d'apprentissage "
"Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning) d'IBM propose les cours, "
"tutoriels et ajouts les plus récents (certains peuvent ne pas encore être "
"dans doQumentation).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Develop locally** — [install "
"Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/guides/install-qiskit) on your own "
"laptop for serious development work.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Développer localement** — [installe "
"Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/guides/install-qiskit) sur ton propre "
"ordinateur portable pour un travail de développement sérieux.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Built on [IBM Quantum's open-source "
"documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation). Thanks to the IBM "
"Quantum team for making this content freely available under CC BY-SA 4.0.*\n"
msgstr ""
"*Construit sur la [documentation open source d'IBM "
"Quantum](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation). Merci à l'équipe IBM "
"Quantum de rendre ce contenu librement disponible sous licence CC BY-SA "
"4.0.*\n"

