#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Code execution {#code-execution}"
msgstr "Exécution de code {#code-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Click **Run** on any code block. The first click starts a Jupyter kernel via"
" [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine). After that, runs are instant.\n"
msgstr ""
"Clique sur **Exécuter** sur n'importe quel bloc de code. Le premier clic "
"démarre un noyau Jupyter via [Binder](https://mybinder.org) ou [IBM Code "
"Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine). Ensuite, les exécutions sont "
"instantanées.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Simulator Mode (no account needed)** — Enable [Simulator Mode](/jupyter-"
"settings#execution-mode) to run all notebooks with AerSimulator or noise-"
"model FakeBackends. Zero setup required.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mode Simulateur (aucun compte requis)** — Active le [Mode "
"Simulateur](/jupyter-settings#execution-mode) pour exécuter tous les "
"notebooks avec AerSimulator ou des FakeBackends avec modèle de bruit. Aucune"
" configuration requise.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Enter your API token and CRN in "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) once — credentials are auto-"
"injected on every run. [Create a free "
"account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) if you don't have "
"one.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Matériel IBM Quantum** — Entre ton jeton API et ton CRN dans les "
"[Paramètres](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) une fois — les identifiants sont"
" injectés automatiquement à chaque exécution. [Crée un compte "
"gratuit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) si tu n'en as pas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Available execution backends</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Backends d'exécution disponibles</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Every tutorial has executable code blocks. Click **Run** to execute them "
"using one of four backends:\n"
msgstr ""
"Chaque tutoriel contient des blocs de code exécutables. Clique sur "
"**Exécuter** pour les exécuter en utilisant l'un des quatre backends :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Binder** (default on GitHub Pages) — Free remote Jupyter kernel via "
"[mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Binder** (par défaut sur GitHub Pages) — Noyau Jupyter distant gratuit via"
" [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter on your IBM Cloud account. Cold "
"start in seconds instead of minutes. [Set up](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine)\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Jupyter serverless sur ton compte IBM Cloud. Démarrage"
" à froid en secondes au lieu de minutes. [Configurer](/jupyter-"
"settings#code-engine)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Local Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Connects to the local Jupyter "
"server with Qiskit pre-installed\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jupyter local (Docker / RasQberry)** — Se connecte au serveur Jupyter "
"local avec Qiskit pré-installé\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Custom server** — Point to any Jupyter endpoint in [Settings](/jupyter-"
"settings#advanced-settings)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Serveur personnalisé** — Pointe vers n'importe quel point de terminaison "
"Jupyter dans les [Paramètres](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When multiple backends are available, choose which one to use from "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"
msgstr ""
"Lorsque plusieurs backends sont disponibles, choisis lequel utiliser depuis "
"les [Paramètres](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</details>\n"
msgstr "</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Deployment options</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Options de déploiement</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "doQumentation is available as:\n"
msgstr "doQumentation est disponible sous forme de :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Static site with "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine) for remote code execution\n"
msgstr ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Site statique avec "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) ou [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine) pour l'exécution de code à distance\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Full stack locally, offline capable\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Stack complète localement, capable de fonctionner hors ligne\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted on Raspberry Pi with "
"local Jupyter kernel\n"
msgstr ""
"**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Auto-hébergé sur Raspberry Pi avec"
" noyau Jupyter local\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Run locally with Podman / Docker</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Exécuter localement avec Podman / Docker</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) or [Docker "
"Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / "
"Linux), then run:\n"
msgstr ""
"Installe [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) ou [Docker "
"Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / "
"Linux), puis exécute :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Open [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — code execution works "
"locally, no Binder wait time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ouvre [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — l'exécution de code "
"fonctionne localement, sans temps d'attente Binder.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For a lightweight version without local code execution (~60 MB):\n"
msgstr "Pour une version légère sans exécution de code locale (~60 Mo) :\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using Docker instead? Just replace `podman` with `docker` — the commands are"
" identical. Images are multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), so Apple "
"Silicon Macs work natively.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tu utilises Docker plutôt que Podman ? Remplace simplement `podman` par "
"`docker` — les commandes sont identiques. Les images sont multi-architecture"
" (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), donc les Mac Apple Silicon fonctionnent "
"nativement.\n"
